# H1 `models2`: a model released while the binary runs. The catalog has one
# model until 9 s after the gateway started and two after; `/model` is opened
# before and after, and the gateway log says which ask got which catalog, and
# when.
models h1-models-one.json
models2 h1-models-two.json 9000
wait 4
type /model
key Enter
wait 2
snap before
key Escape
wait 6
type /model
key Enter
wait 3
snap after
key Escape
wait 0.5
gwlog
